      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mountain_Iron%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1972, Mountain Iron transitioned from a village to an incorporated city, formalizing its local governance.",
